#. <CLT 4>そして、なんとか…
#. 学校の１階までは戻って来たのだが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Somehow, I made it back to the 1st floor of the\n"
"school.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. う…うぅ…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Gh... Nng..."
msgstr ""

#. 歩いたら…ますます気分が……
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The farther I walked, the more I felt..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>目がぼやける…
#. 視界がうまく定まらない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Things are getting blurry... Can't see...in front of\n"
"me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは思わず、
#. その場にうずくまってしまった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I couldn't stop myself from collapsing right there.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>と、その直後だった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And after that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「………………」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"...\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …ん？
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hm...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「………………」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"...\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>遠くから…音が聞こえる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As if from a vast distance, I heard a sound...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「………………」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"...\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>微かだけど、確かに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was faint, but undeniable...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「………………」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"...\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. この音…って…
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That sound..."
msgstr ""

#. 体育館の…方から…？
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's coming from...the gym...?"
msgstr ""
